  "summary": "Windshield wiper access door (wiper cover / wiper door) vacuum actuator and its limit switch, under the cowl, all models. The vacuum actuator & valve assembly [18] is pinned to a body bracket with nut [4]; its rod carries a boot [1], jam nut [2] and the adjusting nut [3] that links it to the door control linkage. The limit switch [13] sits in bracket [12], which is bolted to the body panel with bolt [5]; rod [11] runs from the linkage (bolt [9] and bushings [10]) to the switch, with extension [17], stud [16] and nut [15] at its end. Related sheet: D3 (door control linkage).",
